{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "HEB",
  "chapter": 13,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let brotherly love continue.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be not forgetful to entertain strangers: for by this some have entertained angels unawares.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Remember them that are in bonds, as bound with them; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " them who suffer adversity, as being yourselves also in the body.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Marriage ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " honorable in all, and the bed undefiled: but lewd persons and adulterers God will judge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let your",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " manner of life ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " without covetousness; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " content with such things as ye have: for he hath said, I will never leave thee, nor forsake thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So that we may boldly say, The Lord ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my helper, and I will not fear what man shall do to me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Remember them who have the rule over you, who have spoken to you the word of God: whose faith follow, considering the end of ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " manner of life.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus Christ the same yesterday, and to-day, and for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be not carried about with divers and strange doctrines: for ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a good thing that the heart be established with grace; not with meats, which have not profited them that have been occupied in them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "We have an altar, of which they have no right to eat who serve the tabernacle.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the bodies of those beasts, whose blood is brought into the sanctuary by the high priest for sin, are burned without the camp.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore Jesus also, that he might sanctify the people with his own blood, suffered without the gate.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let us go forth therefore to him without the camp, bearing his reproach.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For here we have no continuing city, but we seek one to come.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By him therefore let us offer the sacrifice of praise to God continually, that is, the fruit of ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "our",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " lips, giving thanks to his name.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But to do good, and to communicate, forget not: for with such sacrifices God is well pleased.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Obey them that have the rule over you, and submit yourselves: for they watch for your souls, as they that must give account, that they may do it with joy, and not with grief: for that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unprofitable for you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Pray for us: for we trust we have a good conscience, in all things willing to live honestly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I beseech ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "you",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the rather to do this, that I may be restored to you the sooner.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now the God of peace, that brought again from the dead our Lord Jesus, that great Shepherd of the sheep, through the blood of the everlasting covenant,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Make you perfect in every good work to do his will, working in you that which is well-pleasing in his sight, through Jesus Christ; to whom ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " glory for ever and ever. Amen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I beseech you, brethren, suffer the word of exhortation: for I have written a letter to you in few words.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Know ye, that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "our",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " brother Timothy is set at liberty; with whom, if he come shortly, I will see you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Salute all them that have the rule over you, and all the saints. They of Italy salute you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.13.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:HEB.13.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Grace ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with you all. Amen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
